This extension adds Return to Castle Wolfenstein modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.
[summary]Supports the Steam, GOG, and Xbox versions,[/summary]

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]GOG[/*]
[*]Xbox[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]IoRTCW mods with an "iowolfsp.x64.exe" file install to the game folder.[/*]
[*]RealRTCW mods with a "realrtcw.x64.exe" file install to the game folder.[/*]
[*]Main Folder mods with a "Main" folder install to the game folder.[/*]
[*]Data (Main) mods with a ".pk3" file install to the "Main" folder.[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[*]Automatic installers for RealRTCW and ioRTCW to remove extra folder above the executables.[/*]
[*]Automatic installers for "Main" folders to remove extra folders above.[/*]
[*]Automatic installers for .pk3 files to "Main" folder.[/*]
[/list]

[b][size=3]It is highly recommended that you download and install one of the following mods to improve the gameplay experience on modern systems. You will be presented with the option to download them in a Vortex notification:[/size][/b]
[list]
[*][b][size=3][b][size=3][url=https://www.moddb.com/mods/realrtcw-realism-mod]RealRTCW[/url]﻿ (Recommended since it is actively supported)﻿[/size][/b][/size][/b][/*]
[*][b][size=3][b][size=3][url=https://github.com/iortcw/iortcw]ioRTCW[/url]﻿[/size][/b][/size][/b][/*]
[/list]

[b]📝 Notes for Mod Authors:[/b]
[spoiler]
Packaging rules for Return to Castle Wolfenstein mods, so Vortex installs them to the right place.

Vortex decides what a mod is by looking at the files and folders inside the archive. It tries each installer in order and the first one that matches wins, so archive layout is what determines where your mod ends up.

========================================================================

Iortcw:

Recognised when the archive contains a "iowolfsp.x64.exe" file.

  Installs to: the game folder

========================================================================

Realrtcw:

Recognised when the archive contains a "realrtcw.x64.exe" file.

  Installs to: the game folder

========================================================================

Mainfolder:

Recognised when the archive contains a "Main" folder.

  Installs to: the game folder

========================================================================

Main:

Recognised when the archive contains a ".pk3" file.

  Installs to: "Main"

========================================================================

Rules That Apply To Every Mod Type:

    - Folder and file name matching is case-insensitive.
    - Extra wrapper folders around a recognised folder are generally fine.
[/spoiler]

